							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							From Dallas, living down in south TEXAS down in the hill country the last year or so. Will be back up there for a month or so coming up here in about 3 weeks. I&#039;d be glad to head down to the Old Monk, and swill a frosty pint of Maredsous or 2 sometime. Always nice to hang with people I can talk EQ to. My normall friends hate it after several hours of my rambling they don&#039;t understand.
